			"notes": "### Features\n- Fixed  #4, where enderman grief wasn't configurable, by adding `no_enderman_grief` config option\n- Added `no_xp_penalty` config option, removing the 7 level cap and always returning 50% of your original levels\n\n### Info\n- If you have used this mod earlier, download the latest `survivaltweaks.properties` file, or make sure to add the `no_enderman_grief=false` or `no_enderman_grief=true` line to your `survivaltweaks.properties` file, together with the `no_xp_penalty=false` or `no_xp_penalty=true` line\n\n### Dependencies\n- Requires [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)\n- Requires fabric 1.19.4"
